              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ghamneawa ghwaraanya aba heedeanyu gideaba geang'oorneegwa iita haleanjeeda sisapa geadi jea eataw fuga ghaydidi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ghaanali gidoowoosti hidaat, ak ghaaghwari geaw aba badahuukeagwa aba heeda fuga Makedoniya, nea gideaba fuga Akaya ea hidaat ghang'eada indeara; iidu gidoogasayi ea niimajeek fuga saang'a mwaatkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu geajeagu fuga eaduupcheewi ak abeeda ea moawa ghwaroodeanya bwaageat aba badahuukeagwa gidamwadaagha aba ng'asheanji, ak abeeda goowooschi hidaat, gawuurji gidearukuteaydi jea awuurjeewana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu nea ghaawunyi nea geadeani fuga Makedoniya, ak ghaahidu nea moowoosi hidaat, gajeapwaaspwaaseasa, ak abeeda ea mwajeamuusa eerukuna gil aba badahuukeagwa, aba damani sindi jeeda masaweegean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaayi gideaba ghwadoabiiw reekusiinda fuga eaduupcheewi ak ghwahidu heedeang'wa gooshooynanean, ak gabean gwasin gidida sigu ghayi ooheeleesiin, ak gagasa ea hidaat ak ea mawuurji gissidiing'sa gawuurji gissiitaydaawa masooda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gaydargu ng'asheanji: siida hista gea ng'ay gayghwalach gea ng'ay, nea siida histeawa inyeanda jeeda gayghwalaja inyeanda jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daba siisi sinda gadiyeeda gidagasiida aba uhuudaanyi, adagwasin nea magassa ghana eediing'sa, aba gideaba ASEETA ghabwariiy siidida adayiida haleanjeeda aba jeedeeshiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ASEETA ghoamu ghoanyiideagwa ghawooda, ak abeeda goondeawi agooga heeluutka haleanjeeda sean aba galeagasean abeeda ghoanyiideagwa muuchi aba giliwas gadiya miy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gissing'oarda bea gideaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
